The trials require measurable disease by RECIST criteria for patient enrollment. 

• NCT04275687 ALLOWS patients with measurable disease according to RECIST criteria;
• NCT05210374 ALLOWS patients who have measurable disease by RECIST criteria at study enrollment;
• NCT04705519 ALLOWS patients who have measurable disease as defined by RECIST 1.1 as determined by investigator assessment;
• NCT04609176 ALLOWS patients who have measurable disease as defined by RECIST 1.1 as determined by investigator assessment;
• NCT03786796 ALLOWS patients who must have measurable disease as defined by RECIST 1.1 criteria;
• NCT05578872 ALLOWS patients who have measurable disease based on RECIST;
• NCT04351230 ALLOWS patients with measurable disease as defined by RECIST criteria;
• NCT03791398 ALLOWS patients who must have measurable disease by RECIST criteria
